{"id":"696270793726f355","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-thm-supercompactness.md","title":"Supercompactness","display":"thm-supercompactness — Supercompactness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-supercompactness","aliases":["58-thm-supercompactness"],"display":"thm-supercompactness — Supercompactness","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-supercompactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-supercompactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-supercompactness — Supercompactness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6a78f267f6eefd08\" href=\"?note=6a78f267f6eefd08\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md\">../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5578254565969219\" href=\"?note=5578254565969219\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (supercompact cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6a78f267f6eefd08\" href=\"?note=6a78f267f6eefd08\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md\">../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}\\)</span> (metalinguistic domain of class quantification)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda &gt; \\kappa\">\\(\\lambda &gt; \\kappa\\)</span> (任意大于 κ 的基数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S\\)</span> (supercompact-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6a78f267f6eefd08\" href=\"?note=6a78f267f6eefd08\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md\">../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_{\\mathrm{meta}},\\mathrm{ElementaryClassEmbedding}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_{\\mathrm{meta}},\\mathrm{ElementaryClassEmbedding}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> (set/cardinal predicate and class-level embedding predicates)</li>\n<li>类映射位置的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{crit}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{crit}(j)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{crit}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{crit}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^\\lambda\\subseteq M\">\\(M^\\lambda\\subseteq M\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall f\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\lambda,\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq M\\to f\\in M)\">\\(\\forall f\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\lambda,\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq M\\to f\\in M)\\)</span>。类嵌入的语义由 <code>58-df-class-embedding-data</code> 给出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}supercompactness} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{Supercompact}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\forall\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\to\\exists_{\\mathrm{Class}}M\\;\\exists_{\\mathrm{Class}}j\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M)\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryClassEmbedding}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,V,M)\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land j(\\kappa)&gt;\\lambda\\land M^\\lambda\\subseteq M\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}supercompactness} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{Supercompact}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\forall\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\to\\exists_{\\mathrm{Class}}M\\;\\exists_{\\mathrm{Class}}j\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M)\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryClassEmbedding}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,V,M)\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land j(\\kappa)&gt;\\lambda\\land M^\\lambda\\subseteq M\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A supercompact cardinal has embeddings for all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda &gt; \\kappa\">\\(\\lambda &gt; \\kappa\\)</span> whose target is closed under <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>-sequences. The embedding and target are class variables, not sets quantified in the object universe.</li>\n<li>Supercompactness is stronger than measurability.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md","status":"resolved","id":"6a78f267f6eefd08","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"5578254565969219","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md","status":"resolved","id":"6a78f267f6eefd08","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa$ (supercompact cardinal, see [[../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md","status":"resolved","id":"6a78f267f6eefd08","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S$ (supercompact-cardinal predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda > \\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_{\\mathrm{meta}},\\mathrm{ElementaryClassEmbedding}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{crit}(j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{crit}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j)","display":false},{"tex":"M^\\lambda\\subseteq M","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall f\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\lambda,\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq M\\to f\\in M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}supercompactness} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{Supercompact}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\forall\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa<\\lambda\\to\\exists_{\\mathrm{Class}}M\\;\\exists_{\\mathrm{Class}}j\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M)\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryClassEmbedding}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(j,V,M)\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land j(\\kappa)>\\lambda\\land M^\\lambda\\subseteq M\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda > \\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false}],"bytes":1925,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4450","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-thm-supercompactness.md|58-thm-supercompactness]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["6a78f267f6eefd08","5578254565969219","5fb1c2241d1943d1","36d7463d215be751"]}